+representing SHA-1 <xref target="RFC3174" format="default" sectionFormat="of" derivedContent="RFC3174"/> and SHA-256 <xref target="RFC6234" format="default" sectionFormat="of" derivedContent="RFC6234"/>, respectively.
+Implementations <bcp14>MUST</bcp14> support both of these algorithms.</dd>
